#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "GPU"
msgstr "GPU"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto (best)"
msgstr "Automatski (najbolji)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Renderer"
msgstr "Iscrtavač"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Software"
msgstr "Softverski"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Which renderer draws the game. Applies on the\n"
"next launch - save settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Koji iscrtavač crta igru. Primjenjuje se pri\n"
"sljedećem pokretanju - spremite postavke i ponovno pokrenite."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Window size"
msgstr "Veličina prozora"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Širina"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Visina"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "1x (native)"
msgstr "1x (izvorno)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "8x (4K)"
msgstr "8x (4K)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D render scale"
msgstr "Skala 3D iscrtavanja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Internal 3D rendering resolution. Higher is crisper 3D\n"
"(2D/HUD stays sharp). GPU backends only; the software\n"
"renderer stays native. Applies on the next launch - save\n"
"settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Interna razlučivost 3D iscrtavanja. Veća daje oštriji 3D\n"
"(2D/HUD ostaje oštar). Samo GPU pozadine; softverski\n"
"iscrtavač ostaje izvoran. Primjenjuje se pri sljedećem\n"
"pokretanju - spremite postavke i ponovno pokrenite."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bilinear"
msgstr "Bilinearno"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Cjelobrojno"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "Najbliže"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sharp-bilinear"
msgstr "Oštro bilinearno"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D scaling"
msgstr "2D skaliranje"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How the frame is magnified to the window.\n"
"Sharp-bilinear keeps 2D text crisp without the shimmer\n"
"nearest shows at non-integer window sizes. Integer snaps\n"
"to a whole multiple (pixel-perfect, with black bars).\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Kako se okvir povećava na prozor.\n"
"Oštro bilinearno čuva 2D tekst oštrim bez treperenja\n"
"koje najbliže pokazuje pri necjelobrojnim veličinama.\n"
"Cjelobrojno poravnava na cijeli višekratnik (savršeni\n"
"pikseli, s crnim trakama). Primjenjuje se odmah."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "16:9 (widescreen)"
msgstr "16:9 (široki zaslon)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "4:3 (arcade)"
msgstr "4:3 (arkadno)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Square pixels"
msgstr "Kvadratni pikseli"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stretch"
msgstr "Rastegni"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Aspect"
msgstr "Omjer"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"4:3 is the arcade monitor's shape (the default).\n"
"Square pixels shows the raw 496x384 (slightly narrow).\n"
"16:9 (experimental) draws the 3D wider, with the 2D in the middle.\n"
"Stretch fills the whole window.\n"
"GPU renderers only. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"4:3 je oblik arkadnog monitora (zadano).\n"
"Kvadratni pikseli prikazuju sirovih 496x384 (malo usko).\n"
"16:9 (eksperimentalno) crta 3D šire, a 2D u sredini.\n"
"Rastegni ispunjava cijeli prozor.\n"
"Samo GPU iscrtavači. Primjenjuje se odmah."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Brightness"
msgstr "Svjetlina"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the Model 2 picture's black sits. 50% is the default,\n"
"matched to an arcade capture; lower is darker, higher is\n"
"brighter. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Gdje stoji crna u slici Model 2. 50 % je zadano,\n"
"prema snimci s automata; manje je tamnije, više je svjetlije.\n"
"Primjenjuje se odmah."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "CRT filter"
msgstr "CRT filtar"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A cosmetic arcade-monitor look over the finished frame:\n"
"scanlines, an RGB shadow mask, glow and optional screen\n"
"curvature. Purely visual; applies live."
msgstr ""
"Kozmetički izgled arkadnog monitora preko gotovog okvira:\n"
"linije skeniranja, RGB maska sjene, sjaj i neobavezna\n"
"zakrivljenost zaslona. Samo vizualno; primjenjuje se odmah."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanlines"
msgstr "Linije skeniranja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "Maska"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Glow"
msgstr "Sjaj"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Curvature"
msgstr "Zakrivljenost"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bezel"
msgstr "Okvir"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In fullscreen, frame the 4:3 picture with an image from\n"
"the bezels directory (Paths tab): <game>.png, the parent\n"
"set's, or default.png. The picture fills the image's\n"
"transparent window."
msgstr ""
"Na cijelom zaslonu uokviruje sliku 4:3 slikom iz\n"
"mape okvira (kartica Putanje): <game>.png, slikom\n"
"roditeljskog skupa ili default.png. Slika igre ispunjava\n"
"prozirni prozor okvira."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enhancement (cosmetic, beyond the original hardware)"
msgstr "Poboljšanje (kozmetičko, izvan izvornog hardvera)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropic"
msgstr "Anizotropno"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Faithful"
msgstr "Vjerno"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D texture filter"
msgstr "Filtar 3D tekstura"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "(unsupported)"
msgstr "(nije podržano)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "This GPU does not report anisotropic filtering."
msgstr "Ovaj GPU ne prijavljuje anizotropno filtriranje."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropy"
msgstr "Anizotropija"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D upscale"
msgstr "2D povećanje"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Edge-smooth the 2D layers (HUD, text, menus). xBR and\n"
"ScaleFX round diagonals; Faithful keeps crisp pixels.\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Zaglađuje rubove 2D slojeva (HUD, tekst, izbornici). xBR i\n"
"ScaleFX zaobljuju dijagonale; Vjerno čuva oštre piksele.\n"
"Primjenjuje se odmah."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Blended"
msgstr "Stopljeno"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stipple"
msgstr "Točkasto"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translucency"
msgstr "Prozirnost"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The hardware draws see-through surfaces (lights, glass,\n"
"shadows) as a checkerboard. Blended draws the 50%\n"
"see-through surface it's trying to achieve. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Hardver crta prozirne površine (svjetla, staklo,\n"
"sjene) kao šahovnicu. Stopljeno crta 50% prozirnu\n"
"površinu koju pokušava postići. Primjenjuje se odmah."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Extended draw distance"
msgstr "Proširena udaljenost iscrtavanja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Draw the scenery to the edge of the course instead of\n"
"the arcade's short range, so it no longer pops in.\n"
"Daytona USA only. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Iscrtava krajolik do ruba staze umjesto\n"
"kratkog dometa automata, pa više ne iskače.\n"
"Samo Daytona USA. Primjenjuje se odmah."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Custom textures"
msgstr "Prilagođene teksture"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Replace the game's 3D textures with images saved in\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, named as dumped. GPU\n"
"renderers only; Reload picks up edited files."
msgstr ""
"Zamjenjuje 3D teksture igre slikama spremljenima u\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, nazvanima kao pri izvozu. Samo\n"
"GPU iscrtavači; Ponovno učitaj preuzima uređene datoteke."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%zu loaded"
msgstr "Učitano: %zu"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Ponovno učitaj"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dump textures"
msgstr "Izvezi teksture"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Collect every 3D texture the game draws and write them,\n"
"with an index.html to browse, to saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"when the game exits or this is turned off."
msgstr ""
"Prikuplja svaku 3D teksturu koju igra crta i zapisuje ih,\n"
"s index.html za pregled, u saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"kad se igra zatvori ili se ovo isključi."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Zvuk"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Paths"
msgstr "Putanje"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "Pregledaj..."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Config directory"
msgstr "Mapa konfiguracije"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where keisho.ini is read from and saved to.\n"
"Set with --config <dir>; cannot be changed here."
msgstr ""
"Odakle se keisho.ini čita i kamo se sprema.\n"
"Postavlja se s --config <dir>; ovdje se ne može promijeniti."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROM directory"
msgstr "Mapa ROM-ova"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the ROM archives live. A game launched by name is\n"
"loaded from here as <name>.zip or <name>.7z."
msgstr ""
"Gdje se nalaze ROM arhive. Igra pokrenuta po imenu\n"
"učitava se odavde kao <name>.zip ili <name>.7z."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Model 1 ROM directory"
msgstr "Mapa Model 1 ROM-ova"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the Model 1 ROM archives live.\n"
"Empty means the ROM directory."
msgstr ""
"Gdje se nalaze Model 1 ROM arhive.\n"
"Prazno znači mapu ROM-ova."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Model 3 ROM directory"
msgstr "Mapa Model 3 ROM-ova"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the Model 3 ROM archives live.\n"
"Empty means the ROM directory."
msgstr ""
"Gdje se nalaze Model 3 ROM arhive.\n"
"Prazno znači mapu ROM-ova."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves directory"
msgstr "Mapa spremanja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Battery-backed saves: per-game NVRAM (.nv) and EEPROM\n"
"(.eeprom) images -- high scores and operator settings."
msgstr ""
"Spremanja s baterijom: NVRAM (.nv) i EEPROM (.eeprom)\n"
"slike po igri -- najbolji rezultati i postavke operatera."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshots directory"
msgstr "Mapa snimki zaslona"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where screenshots are written."
msgstr "Gdje se zapisuju snimke zaslona."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bezels directory"
msgstr "Mapa okvira"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Bezel images: <game>.png, the parent set's, or default.png.\n"
"Empty means a bezels folder beside keisho.ini."
msgstr ""
"Slike okvira: <game>.png, roditeljskog skupa ili default.png.\n"
"Prazno znači mapu bezels pokraj keisho.ini."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Crosshairs directory"
msgstr "Mapa nišana"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Crosshair images: <game>-p1.png (-p2 for player 2) or\n"
"<game>.png for both, then the parent set's, then default.\n"
"Drawn at their own size on a 1080-line picture. Without\n"
"one the built-in crosshair is drawn.\n"
"Empty means a crosshairs folder beside keisho.ini."
msgstr ""
"Slike nišana: <game>-p1.png (-p2 za igrača 2) ili\n"
"<game>.png za oba, zatim od roditeljskog seta, zatim default.\n"
"Crtaju se u vlastitoj veličini na slici od 1080 redaka. Bez\n"
"slike crta se ugrađeni nišan.\n"
"Prazno znači mapa crosshairs pokraj keisho.ini."

