#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Force feedback"
msgstr "Povratna sila"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wheel force on driving games: centring and cornering\n"
"forces decoded from the game's own drive-board commands,\n"
"plus an impact jolt when you hit something."
msgstr ""
"Sila na volanu u vožnji: sile centriranja i zavoja\n"
"dekodirane iz naredbi pogonske ploče same igre,\n"
"plus trzaj pri udarcu kad u nešto udarite."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resistance"
msgstr "Otpor"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A gain on every force of the drive board. At 100 %, the\n"
"board's full power (63) gives the wheel's full force, every\n"
"force in proportion. 200 % doubles every force: those above\n"
"half the board's power (32, Sega Rally's strongest torque)\n"
"then saturate."
msgstr ""
"Pojačanje svih sila pogonske ploče. Na 100 % puna snaga ploče\n"
"(63) daje punu silu volana, svaka sila razmjerno. 200 %\n"
"udvostručuje svaku silu: one iznad pola snage ploče (32,\n"
"najjači moment Sega Rallyja) tada se zasićuju."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Panel spring"
msgstr "Opruga ploče"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The centring spring of the Sega Rally Championship and\n"
"Daytona USA cabinets: very light, it brings the wheel\n"
"back and is barely felt when held against. A share of\n"
"the resistance above. The other games' cabinets drive\n"
"the wheel with no spring, and ignore this setting."
msgstr ""
"Opruga za centriranje automata Sega Rally Championship i\n"
"Daytona USA: vrlo lagana, vraća volan i jedva se osjeti\n"
"kad joj se odupire. Udio otpora iznad. Automati ostalih\n"
"igara pokreću volan bez opruge i zanemaruju ovu postavku."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sega Rally Championship and Daytona USA only, all versions."
msgstr "Samo Sega Rally Championship i Daytona USA, sve verzije."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Drive board DIP strength"
msgstr "DIP snaga pogonske ploče"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The motor strength set on the drive board's DIP switches,\n"
"the switches ON counted in binary: 0 = all OFF.\n"
"Sega Rally: switches 1-3, 0 to 7 added to every torque.\n"
"Daytona USA: switches 1-3, 4 times that.\n"
"Indy 500, Touring Car, Over Rev, Super GT 24h:\n"
"switches 1-1 to 1-3, 0 to 7 added to every force."
msgstr ""
"Snaga motora postavljena DIP prekidačima pogonske ploče,\n"
"prekidači na ON brojeni binarno: 0 = svi OFF.\n"
"Sega Rally: prekidači 1-3, 0 do 7 dodano svakom momentu.\n"
"Daytona USA: prekidači 1-3, četiri puta toliko. Indy 500,\n"
"Touring Car, Over Rev, Super GT 24h: prekidači 1-1 do 1-3,\n"
"0 do 7 dodano svakoj sili."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invert force feedback"
msgstr "Obrni povratnu silu"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a wheel whose driver pushes the wrong way: it pulls\n"
"away from the centre instead of bringing it back, and\n"
"the game's forces go the opposite way."
msgstr ""
"Za volan čiji upravljački program gura u krivu stranu: vuče\n"
"od središta umjesto da ga vraća, a sile\n"
"igre idu u suprotnom smjeru."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble"
msgstr "Vibracija"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vibrates on the game's impacts, for wheels without force\n"
"feedback. It never runs alongside force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Vibrira pri udarcima u igri, za volane bez povratne\n"
"sile. Nikad ne radi istodobno s povratnom silom."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble strength"
msgstr "Jačina vibracije"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Engine vibration"
msgstr "Vibracija motora"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows with the throttle. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Dodatna vibracija koja raste s gasom. Ne dolazi\n"
"iz igre. Isključite je da osjećate samo povratnu silu igre."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%u deg"
msgstr "%u °"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering range"
msgstr "Raspon upravljanja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set this to your wheel's own rotation range. The lock\n"
"angle below is mapped onto it, so matching your wheel\n"
"gives arcade-like response."
msgstr ""
"Postavite na raspon okretanja svojeg volana. Kut\n"
"zaključavanja ispod preslikava se na njega, pa usklađivanje\n"
"s volanom daje odziv kao na arkadnom uređaju."

