#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hold Guide, then press the other button; the game does not see them. Exit "
"goes back to the games when there are some. Service and Test always work."
msgstr ""
"Držite Guide pa pritisnite drugu tipku; igra ih ne vidi. Izlaz vraća na igre "
"kad ih ima. Servis i Test uvijek rade."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Slots are named for this game's controls; dimmed ones are not used. Show "
"shortcuts lists the Guide combinations."
msgstr ""
"Mjesta su nazvana po kontrolama ove igre; zatamnjena se ne koriste. Prikaži "
"prečace navodi kombinacije s Guide."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left stick also moves; the shoulders also act as Button 3/4. Right Lever "
"is Virtual On's. Show shortcuts lists the Guide combinations."
msgstr ""
"Lijeva palica također pomiče; tipke na ramenima služe i kao Button 3/4. "
"Desna poluga pripada igri Virtual On. Prikaži prečace navodi kombinacije s "
"Guide."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stick deadzone"
msgstr "Mrtva zona palice"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Stick travel about centre that reads as centre. The bar shows\n"
"the stick now: let go of it and raise this until the marker\n"
"sits inside the shaded zone. Also applies to stick aiming."
msgstr ""
"Hod palice oko središta koji se čita kao središte. Traka prikazuje\n"
"trenutnu palicu: pustite je i povećavajte ovo dok oznaka ne bude\n"
"unutar osjenčane zone. Vrijedi i za ciljanje palicom."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stick position"
msgstr "Položaj palice"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stick sensitivity"
msgstr "Osjetljivost palice"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Response of a stick's travel past its deadzone. Full deflection\n"
"is always full lock; under 100% the middle of the travel does\n"
"less, over 100% it does more."
msgstr ""
"Odziv hoda palice iza mrtve zone. Puni otklon\n"
"uvijek je puni zaokret; ispod 100% sredina hoda\n"
"djeluje manje, iznad 100% više."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vibrates on the game's impacts in driving games.\n"
"Other games stay quiet."
msgstr ""
"Vibrira pri udarcima u igrama vožnje.\n"
"Ostale igre ostaju tihe."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering vibration"
msgstr "Vibracija upravljanja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows as you steer. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Dodatna vibracija koja raste dok skrećete. Ne dolazi\n"
"iz igre. Isključite je da osjećate samo povratnu silu igre."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Vrati"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Music volume"
msgstr "Glasnoća glazbe"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Only for games with a separate music board: Star Wars\n"
"Arcade, Sega Touring Car Championship and Top Skater.\n"
"Sound effects stay as they are."
msgstr ""
"Samo za igre s zasebnom glazbenom pločom:\n"
"Star Wars Arcade, Sega Touring Car Championship, Top Skater.\n"
"Zvučni efekti ostaju isti."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Per-game volume"
msgstr "Glasnoća po igri"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Raise or lower a game's volume from its default level.\n"
"One slider covers every revision of a game. Off plays\n"
"every game at its default, whatever the sliders say.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: above 100% loud effects can clip (audible\n"
"distortion)."
msgstr ""
"Pojačajte ili utišajte igru u odnosu na zadanu razinu.\n"
"Jedan klizač pokriva sve revizije igre. Isključeno svira\n"
"svaku igru na zadanoj razini, bez obzira na klizače.\n"
"\n"
"Upozorenje: iznad 100% glasni efekti mogu se izobličiti\n"
"(čujno izobličenje)."

