#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The aiming crosshair, with the mouse pointer hidden.\n"
"Auto turns it on in a gun game; On hides the pointer in\n"
"every game; Off never shows a crosshair."
msgstr ""
"Nišan, uz skriveni pokazivač miša.\n"
"Automatski ga uključuje u igri s pištoljem; Uključeno\n"
"skriva pokazivač u svakoj igri; Isključeno nikad ne prikazuje nišan."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show crosshair"
msgstr "Prikaži nišan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Draw Keisho's own crosshair. Turn off if the gun\n"
"has its own sight (e.g. a Sinden). Positional-gun\n"
"titles always draw their own regardless."
msgstr ""
"Crta vlastiti nišan Keisho. Isključite ako pištolj\n"
"ima vlastiti nišan (npr. Sinden). Igre s pozicijskim\n"
"pištoljem uvijek crtaju svoj, bez obzira na ovo."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Centred stick aim"
msgstr "Centrirano ciljanje palicom"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A gamepad's stick points at the screen: the crosshair\n"
"sits in the centre at rest and reaches the edge at full\n"
"tilt. Off, the stick moves the crosshair like a mouse."
msgstr ""
"Palica kontrolera pokazuje na zaslon: nišan je\n"
"u mirovanju u sredini, a pri punom nagibu na rubu.\n"
"Isključeno, palica pomiče nišan kao miš."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide shot flash"
msgstr "Sakrij bljesak pucnja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hide the white flash Virtua Cop, Virtua Cop 2 and\n"
"House of the Dead show on each shot."
msgstr ""
"Skriva bijeli bljesak koji Virtua Cop, Virtua Cop 2 i\n"
"House of the Dead prikazuju pri svakom pucnju."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default player 1 aims with the mouse (the left button fires and the right "
"reloads by shooting off screen) and player 2 with a gamepad."
msgstr "Prema zadanim postavkama igrač 1 nišani mišem (lijeva tipka puca, a desna puni pucanjem izvan zaslona), a igrač 2 kontrolerom."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recoil"
msgstr "Trzaj"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Kick the gun's rumble motor on each shot, for guns\n"
"that have one (Sinden and similar). No effect on a\n"
"gun without a motor."
msgstr ""
"Pokreće motor vibracije pištolja pri svakom pucnju, za\n"
"pištolje koji ga imaju (Sinden i slični). Nema učinka\n"
"na pištolju bez motora."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable recoil"
msgstr "Uključi trzaj"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "Jačina"

